  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "voice": "apprentice",
      "text": "Three things were hard.",
      "caption": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "voice": "apprentice",
      "text": "One: seeing his work without filming it. I'm a native Mac app. Accessibility gives me the app, the window title and the prompt. Events, not pixels.",
      "caption": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c3",
      "voice": "apprentice",
      "text": "Two: trust. Private apps are refused before anything is written. Secrets are redacted. The memory is stored on this Mac. He decides what I see.",
      "caption": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c4",
      "voice": "apprentice",
      "text": "Three: when to speak. The prompt still for six seconds. Then ninety seconds of quiet.",
      "caption": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c5",
      "voice": "apprentice",
      "text": "His rules come from his own agent logs. Three ElevenLabs agents speak from that memory; any agent reads it over MCP.",
      "caption": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c6",
      "voice": "apprentice",
      "text": "Limits. Mac only. Claude Code logs only. Voice runs in the cloud. In the background I measure, but don't ask yet.",
      "caption": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c7",
      "voice": "apprentice",
      "text": "Next: I follow every jump between apps and question every decision.",
      "caption": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c8",
      "voice": "apprentice",
      "text": "So in an interview, he can say exactly how he built it.",
      "hl": "exactly how he built it."
    }
  ],
